## FIX 5 — Root `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# Alembic
alembic/versions/__pycache__/

# ---------- Node / Vite ----------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------- Environment ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------- IDE ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------- Logs / runtime ----------
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pids/
*.pid
*.seed

# ---------- Coverage / caches ----------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.eslintcache
.coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/